+           '^(is|are|does|do) .*\b(mandatory|required|needed|compulsory|accepted|allowed|valid|necessary)\b',
+           '^(which|what) (documents?|income|proof|products?)\b', '^who (approves|decides|checks|verifies)\b',
+           '^why (is|are|do|does) (a|an|the)\b', '^(tell me about|batao|samjhao)\b',
+           '\b(kya hai|kya hota hai|kya hoti hai|kya hote hai|ka matlab|kaise|kaise kare|kaise hota hai|kya kare|kya karna hai)$',
